{
  "name": "connect-profisee-to-profisee-connect-setup",
  "description": "What: Delete (when present), then create 'Service Configuration Profisee To Profisee' and enable 'Strategy Profisee To Profisee Export' on the Main instance. Part of the Profisee to Profisee test track (export only: the service offers no Import flow). Why: A building block of the Connect pack; a test, setup or schedule workload runs it so its steps exist once. When: Never run directly once the pack is tested; its parents run it. Running it alone is safe only when its own Needs are met. Needs: reference values: connect/urls:ConnectBaseUrl, connect/urls:ProfiseeToProfiseeUrl. Success: Every step Succeeded or Skipped. If it fails: Run connect-preflight first; then open the first failed step, whose If it fails text names what to check.",
  "tags": [
    "connect",
    "providers",
    "profisee-to-profisee"
  ],
  "globalParameters": {
    "ConnExBaseUrl": "{{$ref:connect/urls:ConnectBaseUrl}}",
    "ConnExApiKey": "{{$config:RestClients:Connect:ApiKey}}",
